/**
 * @file PooledImmutableParticipantPublicationGraph.cpp
 * @brief Exact nominal metadata and real compute acknowledgments on the original participant graph.
 *
 * Full publication frontier sends retire before acquired receipts overwrite the
 * coordinator bank. Every serial receive is imported before reuse. Local work
 * reads original roots directly; no self transport or multi-device compute is
 * created. Worker retirement does not retire private source response readers.
 */
